<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xsd:schema xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
	targetNamespace="http://ei/core/customer_groupx1">
	<xsd:complexType name="CustomerGroup">
		<xsd:sequence>
			<xsd:element name="CustomerGroupName" type="xsd:string"
				minOccurs="0">
				<xsd:annotation>
					
				<xsd:documentation>
This element specifies the name of the underwriting business unit that produces or services a policy.
The E1T00891 Corporate Table contains valid values for this element in the &quot;CSTMR_LVL_NA&quot; column.
						</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element name="CustomerGroupAbbreviation"
				type="xsd:string" minOccurs="0">
				<xsd:annotation>
					
				<xsd:documentation>
This element specifies the abbreviation of the underwriting business unit that produces or services a policy.
The E1T00891 Corporate Table contains valid values for this element in the &quot;CSTMR_LVL_AB&quot; column.	
						</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
			<xsd:element name="CustomerGroupCode" type="xsd:string"
				minOccurs="0">
				<xsd:annotation>
					
				<xsd:documentation>
This element specifies the code of the underwriting business unit that produces or services a policy.
The E1T00891 Corporate Table contains valid values for this element in the &quot;CSTMR_LVL_C&quot; column. 
						</xsd:documentation></xsd:annotation>
			</xsd:element>
		</xsd:sequence>
	</xsd:complexType>
</xsd:schema>
